<Slide style={{width:1280,height:720,background:'#FFFFFF',flexDirection:'column',position:'relative'}}>
  <Box style={{width:1280,height:64,background:'#1E4FA8',flexDirection:'row',alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'space-between',paddingLeft:28,paddingRight:28}}>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#FFFFFF',fontSize:26,fontWeight:'bold'}}>方法谱系：从修数据到修特征</Text>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#FFFFFF',fontSize:14,opacity:0.85,marginRight:24}}>方法对照</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{flexDirection:'column',gap:20,paddingLeft:60,paddingRight:60,paddingTop:40,paddingBottom:8,flex:1}}>
    <Box style={{background:'#F4F7FB',borderWidth:1,borderColor:'#C9D4E3',borderRadius:6,paddingTop:18,paddingBottom:18,paddingLeft:22,paddingRight:22}}>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,fontWeight:'bold'}}>方法一　重要性加权 —— 修数据分布</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:17,lineHeight:1.6,marginTop:8}}>给"像目标域"的源样本加权：β(x) = 目标密度 / 源密度，一个二分类器即可估计。硬前提是源分布覆盖目标——盖不住，权重爆炸。</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#D9534F',fontSize:15,marginTop:4}}>定位：最直觉的起点，本实验中作为方法谱系对照</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{background:'#F4F7FB',borderWidth:1,borderColor:'#C9D4E3',borderRadius:6,paddingTop:18,paddingBottom:18,paddingLeft:22,paddingRight:22}}>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,fontWeight:'bold'}}>方法二　CORAL —— 修特征二阶统计</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:17,lineHeight:1.6,marginTop:8}}>把两域特征的协方差矩阵拉到一致，等于对齐"形状"而非"位置"。一行公式、无对抗、约 40 行实现，全场最稳。</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#D9534F',fontSize:15,marginTop:4}}>局限：只对齐二阶统计量，高阶差异抹不平</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:18,fontWeight:'bold',marginTop:2}}>三种思路各修什么 —— 从弱到强，逐级递进</Text>
    <Box style={{flexDirection:'row',alignItems:'center',gap:8}}>
      <Box style={{flex:1,background:'#F4F7FB',borderWidth:1,borderColor:'#C9D4E3',borderRadius:6,paddingTop:14,paddingBottom:14,paddingLeft:12,paddingRight:12,alignItems:'center'}}>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:16,fontWeight:'bold'}}>加权</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#4A5568',fontSize:14,textAlign:'center',marginTop:4}}>修数据分布（对样本）</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#D9534F',fontSize:13,marginTop:4}}>前提：源覆盖目标</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Times New Roman',color:'#1E4FA8',fontSize:24,fontWeight:'bold'}}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{flex:1,background:'#F4F7FB',borderWidth:1,borderColor:'#C9D4E3',borderRadius:6,paddingTop:14,paddingBottom:14,paddingLeft:12,paddingRight:12,alignItems:'center'}}>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Times New Roman',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:16,fontWeight:'bold'}}>CORAL</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#4A5568',fontSize:14,textAlign:'center',marginTop:4}}>修二阶统计（对特征）</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1E4FA8',fontSize:13,marginTop:4}}>代价最小、最稳</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Times New Roman',color:'#1E4FA8',fontSize:24,fontWeight:'bold'}}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{flex:1.15,background:'#E8EFF8',borderWidth:2,borderColor:'#1E4FA8',borderRadius:6,paddingTop:14,paddingBottom:14,paddingLeft:12,paddingRight:12,alignItems:'center'}}>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1E4FA8',fontSize:16,fontWeight:'bold'}}>DANN（下一页）</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#4A5568',fontSize:14,textAlign:'center',marginTop:4}}>对抗修高阶差异（对表示）</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1E4FA8',fontSize:13,marginTop:4}}>最强但最需技巧——本实验已验证</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{position:'absolute',bottom:24,left:60,right:60,background:'#E8EFF8',paddingTop:12,paddingBottom:12,paddingLeft:20,paddingRight:20,borderRadius:4}}>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20}}>对齐能力最强、也最需要技巧的是第三种——下面单独讲它</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{position:'absolute',bottom:0,left:60,right:60,flexDirection:'row',justifyContent:'space-between'}}>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#8B97A8',fontSize:14}}>DANN 复现 · 迁移学习课程大作业</Text>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Times New Roman',color:'#8B97A8',fontSize:14}}>05 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
